{"availability":"available","full":"SeerRay-Lab/Xiaomi-GUI","name":"Xiaomi-GUI","description":"[Technical Report] An End-to-End Multimodal GUI Agent for Real Mobile Environments","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":87,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-17T07:36:05Z","updated":"2026-10-15T13:41:13Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://seerray-lab.github.io/Xiaomi-GUI-0/","topics":[],"demo":"https://seerray-lab.github.io/Xiaomi-GUI-0/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:26.610Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:26.610Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:26.610Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:34.631Z","stars":87,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:14:34.441Z","stars":87,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:26.610Z","stars":87,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Trained and evaluated in a real-device closed loop — closing the benchmark-to-reality gap.","High benchmark scores do not reliably predict performance on real devices, where account states, permission dialogs, payment authentication, and risk-control mechanisms continually reshape the state distribution a GUI agent encounters. To close this gap, Xiaomi-GUI-0 is a native end-to-end multimodal GUI agent for real mobile environments, trained and evaluated within a real-device closed loop:"],"features":["📱 Real-device-dominant infrastructure: hundreds of physical phones, tablets, and in-vehicle cockpits, complemented by sandboxes, so collection, training, and evaluation share one real-deployment distribution.","🔁 Error-driven data flywheel: failure trajectories from real rollouts are converted into corrected actions, reflective rationales, and recovery demonstrations.","🎯 Progressive three-stage training: SFT → Step RL → Agentic RL incrementally builds basic interface operation, long-horizon planning, and error recovery.","🧪 RealMobile benchmark: 100 real-device tasks across 14 live apps, scored by fine-grained sub-goals, with 57% spanning multiple applications."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SeerRay-Lab/Xiaomi-GUI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7511c296073e846f2e7db8f58356b6ac08ff9e1b3c929309cff1e9df12d93359","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:26.744Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:26.744Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Trained and evaluated in a real-device closed loop — closing the benchmark-to-reality gap.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SeerRay-Lab/Xiaomi-GUI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7511c296073e846f2e7db8f58356b6ac08ff9e1b3c929309cff1e9df12d93359","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SeerRay-Lab/Xiaomi-GUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:26.744Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T13:41:13Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SeerRay-Lab/Xiaomi-GUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:26.744Z","hash":"7511c296073e846f2e7db8f58356b6ac08ff9e1b3c929309cff1e9df12d93359","originalBytes":6830,"storedBytes":6830,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["realmobile","real","agent","tasks","across","benchmark","gui","evaluation","liu","real-device","sub-goals","xiaomi-gui-0","android","applications","apps","each","evaluated","fine-grained","live","planning","step","androidworld","basic","built","closed","code","collection","completed","data","demo","devices","directory","end-to-end","environments","eval","fraction","gemini","guiness","jian","knowledge","launched","long-horizon","loop","mobile","multimodal","multiple","nbsp","only","operations","over","physical","plus","pro","progress","released","report","repository","scored","scores","screenshots","seed","success","sun","technical","trained","training","trajectories","what","world","zhang","accessibility","account","actions","adaptive","adb","against","agentic","aggregation","anan","androidworld.","application","applications.","applying","archiveprefix","arxiv","attem